config XSI_MULTI_PROCESS
	bool "X/Open multi process"
	depends on XSI
	depends on POSIX_MULTI_PROCESS
	help
	  Select 'y' here and Zephyr will provide implementations of
	  getrlimit(), getrusage() and setrlimit(). The resource limits are
	  the build's and cannot be changed; getpriority(), nice(),
	  setpriority() and ulimit() are not provided.
